109
00:08:06,125 --> 00:08:10,545
From then on, only traffic allowed by some policy gets in.

110
00:08:10,545 --> 00:08:13,365
Pods selected by no policy stay open.

111
00:08:13,365 --> 00:08:17,556
Policies only add permissions; there is no "deny" rule.

